The Core Innovation

Bitcoin asks:

"Who owns this digital money?"

Ethereum asks:

"What can programmable ownership do?"

SOS69069 asks:

"What participation has been permanently recorded by the protocol?"

This represents a different category of blockchain protocol—one where verified participation replaces transferable ownership, atomic mint events replace token transfers, and immutable blockchain history becomes the foundation of trust.

